  "limits": [
    "The case set is hand-written by the agent, not sampled from model output: it measures behaviour on wording, not a false-positive rate.",
    "One log and one canon are used for every arm, including the direct arm that never saw them; chapter rows are shared on purpose so the comparison is about prose, not about a different timeline.",
    "The clean corpus is nine chapters from three runs of the same canon; they are not independent samples of a distribution.",
    "Only asserted travel is visible: 歩いた and 見えた are known misses, and are kept in the table rather than dropped from it."
